t\t\t<div id=\"event_7086\" class=\"advance_price\">\n<style>\n    .event-detail-meta span a,\n    .each-price.each-meta span a {\n        padding: 5px 6px 2px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream .active,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream .active {\n        background: black;\n        color: white !important;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream a.active:hover,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream a.active:hover {\n        background: #ccc;\n        color: black !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            <span>&pound;22</span>\n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                                <span>\n                                    <a class=\"active\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"javascript: appendToCart({pk:'15780', type: 'event',}, this); return false;\">\n                                        &pound;20 Advance\n                                    </a>\n                                </span>\n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                                \n                                    <span><a href=\"/membership/\"><span>&pound;14 MEMBERS</span></a></span>\n                                \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n    <!-- Live Stream prices -->\n    \n\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-text-container\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"event-detail-intro-container\">\n\t\t\t        <p>Pleased to host the Discrepant vs Keroxen London Festival 2026 across three nights at OTO!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>All individual entries come with a free vinyl record.</strong></em></p>\r\n<p><em><strong>All three day pass come with a free vinyl record + free entry to Keroxen Festival 2027 in Tenerife.</strong></em></p>\r\n<p>Keroxen / Discrepant is a festival and label based in Tenerife, Canary Islands, Spain. The label focuses on publishing mainly experimental and non-mainstream music by Canarian artists as well as national and international acts associated with the festival. Since 2021, Keroxen has become part of the Discrepant network.</p>\r\n<p>With a commitment to showcasing unique and boundary-pushing sounds, *Keroxen / Discrepant* provides a platform for artists who defy traditional genres and embrace innovation. Through their releases, they offer listeners an opportunity to explore unconventional musical landscapes created by talented musicians from the Canary Islands and beyond.</p>\r\n<p>As both a festival and label, *Keroxen / Discrepant* actively supports the growth of experimental music scenes locally and globally. By fostering collaborations between diverse artists, they contribute to the development of an inclusive community that celebrates artistic exploration and creative expression.</p>\r\n<p>All three days feature a light installation by N&eacute;stor Torrens &amp; Pura Marqu&eacute;z</p>\r\n<p>Record market with both labels catalogue during the three days</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-text-container\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"event-detail-intro-container\">\n\t\t\t        <p><em>With support from the Canary Islands Institute for Cultural Development (ICDC)</em></p>\r\n<p><em><img src=\"https://media.cafeoto.co.uk/uploads/images/discrepant-residency-logos.jpg?ts=1787303653\" alt=\"logos\" width=\"75%\" /><br /></em></p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"activity-container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"section-title\">You may also like</h1>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"activity-container-inner\">\n                \n                \n                    <div class=\"each-activity event-detail-each-artist col-xs-6 col-sm-3\">\n                        \n                            \n                                <a href=\"\"><h2 class=\"sub-title\">18–20 December 2026, 7.30–11pm</h2></a>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"event-detail-image\">\n                                <a href=\"/events/baba-yagas-hut-dj-scotch-egg-2026/\"><img src=\"https://media.cafeoto.co.uk/_versions/images/dj-scotch-egg-2026_grayscale.jpg?ts=1787740174\" /></a>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                        <h2 class=\"sub-title\"><a href=\"/events/baba-yagas-hut-dj-scotch-egg-2026/\">DJ Scotch Egg  – Three-Day Residency</a></h2>\n                        \n                            \n                                <div class=\"event-detail-meta\">\n                                    \n                                        <span><a href=\"/events/baba-yagas-hut-dj-scotch-egg-2026/\" class=\"active\">MORE INFO & TICKETS</a></span>\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            \n                        \n                    </div>\n                \n                    <div class=\"each-activity event-detail-each-artist col-xs-6 col-sm-3\">\n                        \n                            \n                                <h2 class=\"sub-title\"><a href=\"\">13 Oct 2026 – 7:30PM</a></h2>\n