div class=\"content-container upset-the-rhythm-grouper\"> <!-- Always required do to fixed header -->\n\t<div class=\"activity-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8\">\n\t\t            \n\t\t            <div class=\"event-detail-date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>18–19 November 2026</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-slider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://media.cafeoto.co.uk/_versions/images/Grouper-2026-Scotland-crop_main.jpg?ts=1787912130\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1><span class=\"prefix\">Upset the Rhythm:</span> Grouper – Two-Day Residency</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"activity-container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"activity-container-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-activity col-sm-12\" style=\"margin-top:20px; margin-bottom: 35px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-activity col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/events/upset-the-rhythm-grouper-1/\">Wednesday 18 November 2026, 7.30pm</a><br/><a href=\"/events/upset-the-rhythm-grouper-1/\">Grouper + Short Film Screening</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"event_7098\" class=\"advance_price\">\n<style>\n    .event-detail-meta span a,\n    .each-price.each-meta span a {\n        padding: 5px 6px 2px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream .active,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream .active {\n        background: black;\n        color: white !important;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream a.active:hover,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream a.active:hover {\n        background: #ccc;\n        color: black !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n    <!-- Live Stream prices -->\n    \n\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-activity col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/events/upset-the-rhythm-grouper-2/\">Thursday 19 November 2026, 7.30pm</a><br/><a href=\"/events/upset-the-rhythm-grouper-2/\">Grouper + Coby Sey</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"event_7099\" class=\"advance_price\">\n<style>\n    .event-detail-meta span a,\n    .each-price.each-meta span a {\n        padding: 5px 6px 2px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream .active,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream .active {\n        background: black;\n        color: white !important;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream a.active:hover,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream a.active:hover {\n        background: #ccc;\n        color: black !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n    <!-- Live Stream prices -->\n    \n\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-text-container\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"event-detail-intro-container\">\n\t\t\t        <p><strong>Please note these shows are SOLD OUT. A waiting list for returns is available on Dice:</strong><br /><strong><br />- 18 November: <a href=\"https://link.dice.fm/Mcb92f87691c\" target=\"_blank\">https://link.dice.fm/Mcb92f87691c</a></strong><br /><strong>- 19 November:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://link.dice.fm/y5d22ad9b9c9\" target=\"_blank\">https://link.dice.fm/y5d22ad9b9c9</a></strong></p>\r\n<p><br />GROUPER is a recording and performing project by Liz Harris. She lives and works on the Oregon Coast. On the first night, we&rsquo;ll also present two short films by Takashi Makino and Tanja Engleberts, both recently scored by Liz. The second evening will open with a live set by Coby Sey.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://grouper.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://grouper.bandcamp.com/</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-text-container\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"event-detail-intro-container\">\n\t\t\t        \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"activity-container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"section-title\">You may also like</h1>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"activity-container-inner\">\n                \n                \n                    <div class=\"each-activity event-detail-each-artist col-xs-6 col-sm-3\">\n                        \n                            \n                                \n                                    <h2 class=\"sub-title\"><a href=\"/shop/folk-magic-band-folk-magic-band/\">Vinyl</a></h2>\n                                \n                                <div class=\"event-detail-image\">\n                              