span id=\"event_page\" style=\"display: none;\"></span>\n<div class=\"content-container sonic-cinema-tony-conrads-loose-connection\"> <!-- Always required do to fixed header -->\n\t<div class=\"activity-container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8\">\n\t\t            \n\t\t            <div class=\"event-detail-date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sunday 11 October 2026, 7.30pm</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-slider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"each-slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://media.cafeoto.co.uk/_versions/images/TonyConrad_LooseConnection_Still1_main.jpg?ts=1788940696\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1><span class=\"prefix\">Sonic Cinema:</span> Tony Conrad’s Loose Connection + Billy Steiger</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"event_7113\" class=\"advance_price\">\n<style>\n    .event-detail-meta span a,\n    .each-price.each-meta span a {\n        padding: 5px 6px 2px 4px;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream .active,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream .active {\n        background: black;\n        color: white !important;\n    }\n\n    .event-detail-meta .stream a.active:hover,\n    .each-price.each-meta .stream a.active:hover {\n        background: #ccc;\n        color: black !important;\n    }\n</style>\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            <span>&pound;17</span>\n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                                <span>\n                                    <a class=\"active\" href=\"#\" onclick=\"javascript: appendToCart({pk:'15849', type: 'event',}, this); return false;\">\n                                        &pound;15 Advance\n                                    </a>\n                                </span>\n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                                \n                                    <span><a href=\"/membership/\"><span>&pound;10 MEMBERS</span></a></span>\n                                \n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n    <!-- Live Stream prices -->\n    \n\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-text-container\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"event-detail-intro-container\">\n\t\t\t        <p>Sonic Cinema presents a rare screening of Tony Conrad&rsquo;s audiovisual experiment <em>Loose Connection</em> (1973/2011) preceded by a live solo performance by violinist Billy Steiger.</p>\r\n<p>Shot in 1973 and revisited in 2011, <em>Loose Connection</em> is an experimental documentary of family life in Midtown Manhattan, where Tony Conrad lived with Beverly Grant and their son Ted. Taking a self-built rotating camera around his locale of West 42nd Street, Conrad interrupts the viewer's spatial orientation with fragmentary, flickering images, anchored by the staccato noise of the street.</p>\r\n<p>Though it shares a formal lineage with Conrad's earlier films such as <em>The Flicker</em> (1966), as well as Michael Snow's mechanical experiments, the documentary elements of <em>Loose Connection</em> give it unexpected warmth. Conrad&rsquo;s openness about the production process and conversations with curious passersby lend the film a personality akin to the home movie as much as structural filmmaking, pushing the film beyond the austere formalism typically associated with the tradition.</p>\r\n<p>Perhaps best known for his stroboscopic film <em>The Flicker</em> and his music with the Theatre of Eternal Music, also known as the Dream Syndicate, and German experimental rock band Faust, Tony Conrad (1940&ndash;2016) pioneered work with visual phenomena and sustained tone that helped shape decades of experimental film and music that followed. Moving just as freely between film &amp; video, music, sculpture, and public access television, his multidisciplinary practice resists easy categorisation, often challenging the modes of production and relationships of power embedded within media forms.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-text-container\">\n\t\t\t    <div class=\"event-detail-intro-container\">\n\t\t\t        <p><em>Please note: due to the flashing images in this film, it may not be suitable for people with epilepsy or other light sensitivity conditions.</em></p>\r\n<p><strong>PROGRAMME:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Billy Steiger (live)</li>\r\n<li><em>Loose Connection</em>, Tony Conrad, USA, 1973/2011, 54 min, Super 8 &gt; 16mm &gt; HD video</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>Courtesy the Estate of Tony Conrad and Greene Naftali, New York.</em></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to the Sonic Cinema mailing list here: <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/12c77b6b762d/sonic-cinema\" target=\"_blank\">https://mailchi.mp/12c77b6b762d/sonic-cinema</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\t\n\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-each-artist-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-each-artist col-xs-12 col-sm-5 col-sm-offset-rt-1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1><a href=\"/artists/billy-steiger/\">Billy Steiger</a></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Billy Steiger is an artist working across performance, recording, drawing, and printmaking. This work often takes systems of reproduction, transmission and mediation as both material and subject.</p>\r\n<p>Active/upcoming solo projects include:<br />- a proposed (re)history of technology, using the vibrating string as framing mechanism.<br />- an album of modified pipe organ recordings, to be released by OtoRoku in 2027.<br />- an ongoing investigation into audio compression algorithms and the artefacts and loss inherent to digital/analogue boundary states.</p>\r\n<p>Active group projects include:<br />- O Yama O (w/ Keiko Yamamoto, Rie Nakajima, Marie Roux)<br />- X-Ray Hex Tet (w/ Paul Abbott, Edward George, Crystabel Riley, Pat Thomas, Seymour Wright)<br />- Portraits (w/ Daniel Blumberg, Seymour Wright)</p>\r\n<p>Completed(?) solo projects include:<br />- composing and recording the score for Stacy Martin's short film <em>Amaretti</em><br />- <em>Box (for EKM)</em> for piano and string quartet, premiered by Apartment House in 2024<br />- <em>Loud Object</em>, a 2023 violin record.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://billysteiger.bandcamp.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://billysteiger.bandcamp.com/</a></p>\r\n<p><iframe src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/279814901&amp;color=%23ff5500&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;show_teaser=true\" frameborder=\"no\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"166\"></iframe></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event-detail-each-artist-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://media.cafeoto.co.uk/_versions/images/billy-steiger-photo_main.jpg?ts=1655897416\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\n<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n    <div class=\"activity-container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12\">\n                <h1 class=\"section-title\">You may also like</h1>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"activity-container-inner\">\n                \n                \n                    <div class=\"each-activity event-detail-each-artist col-xs-6 col-sm-3\">\n                        \n                            \n                                <a href=\"\"><h2 class=\"sub-title\">29–31 October 2026, 7.30–11pm</h2></a>\n                            \n                            <div class=\"event-detail-image\">\n                                <a href=\"/events/discrepant-vs-keroxen-london-festival-2026/\"><img src=\"https://media.cafeoto.co.uk/_versions/images/PRINCIPAL_900x600px_grayscale.png?ts=1789576586\" /></a>\n                            </div>\n                        \n                        <h2 class=\"sub-title\"><a href=\"/events/discrepant-vs-keroxen-london-festival-2026/\">Discrepant vs Keroxen London Festival 2026</a></h2>\n                        \n                            \n                                <div class=\"event-detail-meta\">\n                                    \n                                        <span><a href=\"/events/discrepant-vs-keroxen-london-festival-2026/\" class=\"active\">MORE INFO & TICKETS</a></span>\n                                    \n                                </div>\n                            \n                        \n                    </div>\n                \n                    <div class=\"each-activity event-detail-eac